# File biner: jangan diubah line ending-nya dan jangan di-diff sebagai teks
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.fbx binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Scene dan prefab Unity (YAML) digabung dengan UnityYAMLMerge jika dikonfigurasi
*.unity merge=unityyamlmerge
*.prefab merge=unityyamlmerge
*.asset merge=unityyamlmerge
*.mat merge=unityyamlmerge
*.meta merge=unityyamlmerge
